    "text_888598716_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 19 2026 16:48:38 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Versatile</span></span></p>\n<p>POM is a versatile multi-port oxygen mask, designed to accommodate a wide range of scopes, probes, and tubes with ease. With its unique design, it allows for hassle-free insertion through the patient’s mouth or nose, all while maintaining optimal oxygen delivery. POM is engineered to maximize oxygen flow and provide respiratory rate monitoring for enhanced safety.</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Feb 19 2026 17:10:35 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "cq:responsive": {
